            be a morphism of rings. Then we have an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjunction"} adjunction
          .maruku-equation
            %math#mathml_38f85b6fe6e1ae443dfdccc7d9732b950176ebd6_2.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
